| prelim→spec | narrowed | Part F (ConstantMueller editor) | Both docs agree: the `PolarizerBehavior`/`PolarizerCategory` describability DUs enter, the dedicated ConstantMueller editor stays out of scope (prelim §10.3 = spec Part F). No drift — a pre-agreed narrowing. |
