`LibraryWindow`, `SolverHandoffWindow`, `SceneProxy`, `ExperimentCollectionProxy`,
`ExperimentDataProxy`, `TestDbContext`, `SeedingProxy`). The entries below are the
spec's **intentional** out-of-scope boundaries — confirmed not-shipped by design, i.e.
not defects — plus the coverage caveat.

| origin | kind | ref | note |
|---|---|---|---|
| spec→impl | unverified | Part F | The dedicated ConstantMueller editor is out of scope by design; the DU is describable, the editor did not ship — as intended. |
| spec→impl | unverified | Part I | `.ocproj` disk format stays unwired; scene / experiment IO shipped as in-memory proxies (`SceneProxy`, `ExperimentCollectionProxy`) with round-trip tests only. Intended. |
| spec→impl | unverified | Part L | Only the inverse **wiring** shipped (`SolverHandoffWindow` + validation); the solver and any data normalization are out of scope by design. |
